	(text_box "LM2596 outputs PWM signal. it attempts to keep its FB pin at 1.23 by adjusting the output duty cycle. As such the voltage divider circuit we have will force the FB higher/lower and the output will adjust to compensate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57.404 82.804 0)
